   218	degrees of adaptivity. Note that the server updates of our methods are invariant to ﬁxed multiplicative
   219	changes to the client learning rateηl for appropriately chosenτ, though as we shall see shortly, we
   220	will requireηl to be sufﬁciently small in our analysis.
