   802	iv) CINIC-10 (Darlow et al., 2018). In all experiments, we compare against the following baselines
   803	i) FedAvg, ii) SCAFFOLD (Karimireddy et al., 2020b), and iii) FedAdagrad (Reddi et al., 2021)
   804	which is a federated version of the popular Adagrad algorithm. To the best of our knowledge, we
